              </div>
              <h5 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1 hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400 cursor-pointer">Sketch from A to Z: for app designer</h5>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 mb-3 truncate">Proposal indulged no do sociable he throwing settling.</p>
              <div class="flex items-center text-yellow-400 text-sm space-x-1">
